WEBVTT

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:18.110
Welcome to my castle!

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:28.980
It's happening! The space-time
phase is changing!

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.620
It doesn't seem any different as far as I can see.

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:35.760
It just seems like the same ocean
we've been in this whole time.

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:38.520
The times we've been in the ocean
have actually been quite rare.

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:40.460
It looks like the Ocean Puzzle has moved.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.960
Outside it looks like the same ocean as before,

00:00:43.070 --> 00:00:45.510
but it's quite possible that it's
an entirely different space.

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:49.580
All hands, keep watch for any
sudden changes. That is all!

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:57.050
I'm just trying to help you with all of this,
but you just don't get it, do you?

00:00:57.290 --> 00:01:00.810
Shut up already! That's enough!
Just leave me alone!

00:01:01.690 --> 00:01:03.020
What?!

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:09.590
Who do you think has taken care of you all this
time since Mom and Dad have been gone?!

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.560
But I did all of the cleaning and laundry.

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:17.970
I made you dinner every day, didn't I?!

00:01:18.270 --> 00:01:19.740
Nothing but instant food.

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:22.500
Quit complaining all the time!

00:01:22.940 --> 00:01:25.410
Can't you just listen to what
your older sister says?!

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:27.870
Don't brag just because you're older!

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:34.780
Glance.

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:40.630
It's a monster! My face is floating!

00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:00.650
Sis?

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:13.380
Stop copying me!

00:02:18.870 --> 00:02:21.630
What? I wonder what happened out there?

00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:27.630
Sis...

00:02:34.180 --> 00:02:35.580
What?! What's so funny?

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:39.210
It took your face and made it all weird!

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:44.280
Weird?! Did you say weird?!

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:47.460
Hey, out there! You think it's funny
to copy people's faces?!

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:50.030
Hey, come on out of there and show yourself!

00:02:50.030 --> 00:02:52.370
It looks like it's gone.

00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:56.060
Shut up! You're all making fun of me now!

00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:04.600
Now I'm really mad! I'll never let them
get away with this!

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:07.210
Don't take it too seriously.

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:09.570
I'm not taking it too seriously.

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:10.790
You are so!

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:12.050
Shut up!

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:14.650
No, I won't shut up!

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:16.180
Let go of me!

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:17.330
No, I won't let go!

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:18.430
Let go!

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:19.950
I'm not letting go!

00:03:29.570 --> 00:03:30.700
Sis!

00:03:33.340 --> 00:03:36.330
Sis!

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:08.240
The light of dawn pours over the vast Earth

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:08.240
Daichi ni sosogu yoake

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:15.740
And marks the beginning of our journey

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:15.740
Tabidatsu toki wo tsugeru

00:04:17.720 --> 00:04:24.850
With our eyes on the future

00:04:17.720 --> 00:04:24.850
Mirai wo mezashi kaketeyuku kaze

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:30.960
I deeply breathe in the rushing wind

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:30.960
Kono mune ni suikonda

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:40.600
The eyes that could only speak in dreams

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:40.600
Yume dake wo kizamitsuketa hitomi

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:48.110
Presented us with the path we're to take

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:48.110
Bokura ni yuku michi wo ataeru

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:53.820
Fly to the Neverland

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:53.820
Fly to the Neverland

00:04:53.890 --> 00:05:03.320
Awaken the unlimited courage inside of us

00:04:53.890 --> 00:05:03.320
Kagiri nai yuuki wo mezamesasete

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:13.010
Welcome to the sea of Wonderland.

00:05:15.010 --> 00:05:18.880
I am Fabula, your guide.

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:25.750
Tenacity resurrected, the red Madoushi.

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:31.830
The white Makenshi, settling the past.

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:36.960
And now, having escaped from
the malicious sea of clouds,

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:40.960
the time for a new encounter
is upon our travelers.

00:05:41.740 --> 00:05:44.640
It will be a time of trial for you.

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:21.430
The ocean and the sky are upside down!

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:28.770
Oh, Omega!

00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:33.080
You've taken one more step towards perfection!

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:36.550
This has made the puzzle worth creating.

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:39.390
While Chaos gains more and more energy,

00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:42.130
I search out the scattered pieces
of Omega in Wonderland.

00:06:42.530 --> 00:06:47.230
It is a truly, truly, TRULY, wonderful
system, if I do say so myself.

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:50.300
Omega Recovery Team!

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:53.970
I command you to search inside
the cubes for Omega!

00:07:02.280 --> 00:07:04.510
So we're not going to go help Sis?!

00:07:04.890 --> 00:07:05.850
Why is that?!

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:08.650
Because the bottom of this ocean is the sky.

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:13.030
I'm sorry, I didn't follow that.

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:16.260
Underneath the ocean there is a vast sky.

00:07:16.530 --> 00:07:19.090
So Ai fell to the sky under there?

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:22.360
Jane can't fly, so...

00:07:22.840 --> 00:07:26.710
It's also possible that some of the
Earl's henchmen are down there.

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:29.040
That Makenshi again?

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:34.580
This can't be...

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:44.160
That's right, I forgot we do have
one sure way to fly!

00:07:45.190 --> 00:07:47.020
There, right there!

00:07:48.130 --> 00:07:50.430
Oh, that's right, I almost forgot!

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:04.610
I'm so tired.

00:08:04.610 --> 00:08:06.010
Hey, Poshepocket?

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:09.910
I want to contact everyone else.

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:13.350
I don't care if it's a phone or what,
but can you give me something?

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:26.690
Man, just what I need when I'm tired. Thank you!

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:29.200
So good!

00:08:29.300 --> 00:08:32.670
No! I want to get in touch with everyone!

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:37.740
What in the world is all of this?!

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:53.020
What's so funny?! It's rude to sit back
there and watch me in secret!

00:08:54.160 --> 00:08:55.690
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:08:57.770 --> 00:08:59.130
That wasn't what I intended,

00:08:59.230 --> 00:09:02.070
but it just seemed like you were
having so much fun.

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:10.740
What's up with that weird getup
that you're wearing?

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:12.170
No, don't!

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:15.570
You mustn't touch me!

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:19.080
You'll break...

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:22.050
What? What are you talking about?

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:31.250
What?! What the heck is that thing?

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:08.060
Poshepocket! Give me a weapon or something
so I can take care of them! Please!

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:18.310
What is this?

00:10:19.210 --> 00:10:22.110
What am I supposed to do
with this banana peel?

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:44.530
Help me!

00:11:15.200 --> 00:11:17.230
Who were those guys?

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:20.270
They came for me.

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:24.170
For you? What are you doing?

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:27.280
Looking for my brothers.

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:31.480
You have brothers? I have a little brother too.

00:11:34.020 --> 00:11:37.050
Shut up, okay? Don't worry about Yu and me.

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:47.530
I'm Ai Hayakawa. Who are you?

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:56.110
It was okay when I touched you before.

00:11:57.580 --> 00:12:01.140
I'm Clear. People call me Clear.

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:03.420
People call you?

00:12:03.980 --> 00:12:05.980
I'm glad that you didn't break.

00:12:06.650 --> 00:12:08.850
I wonder if it was because of this Flying Water?

00:12:09.460 --> 00:12:11.320
You mean the Flying Water from Teros?

00:12:11.990 --> 00:12:13.650
You mustn't concern yourself with me!

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:19.260
These clothes, made from Flying Water,
hold back my powers,

00:12:20.270 --> 00:12:22.740
but someday I will surely break everything!

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:27.830
I won't be able to stop myself,
even if I'm just walking or blinking.

00:12:29.280 --> 00:12:30.740
It sounds like Omega.

00:12:31.650 --> 00:12:33.010
Yes.

00:12:33.280 --> 00:12:34.750
I am Omega.

00:12:43.290 --> 00:12:45.690
Pist!

00:12:46.060 --> 00:12:48.360
How are you doing, Your Excellency?

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:49.860
Skip the formalities.

00:12:50.300 --> 00:12:52.230
It says here that the trick for the day will be

00:12:52.600 --> 00:12:56.900
your monsters attacking the submarine.
What's going wrong?

00:12:57.270 --> 00:12:59.330
You'll have to excuse me for that,

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:03.510
but the truth is that I've found a part of Omega.

00:13:03.810 --> 00:13:07.750
Oh, wow! You found yet another piece?

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:10.070
So did you gather it up?

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:13.680
I'm afraid that it escaped.

00:13:14.790 --> 00:13:16.120
What a bad boy.

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:17.920
It escaped?

00:13:18.460 --> 00:13:22.520
So by that you mean that it was not
another crystal, right?

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:25.930
Hold on. Do you mean to tell me that
you finally found Clear?!

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:30.940
That's just like Your Excellency,
always so quick on the uptake.

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:34.370
Great job, Pist!

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:39.640
Do you have any prospects
of recovering him, Lord Pist?

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:42.310
But of course!

00:13:45.690 --> 00:13:47.050
Are you scared of me?

00:13:48.320 --> 00:13:52.880
I'm not sure, but you're different
than the Omega that I know.

00:13:53.730 --> 00:13:56.490
You're actually really nice.

00:14:04.340 --> 00:14:07.710
Were those your brothers?

00:14:17.480 --> 00:14:20.390
She's not here, is she?
I wonder where she could be?

00:14:21.620 --> 00:14:23.180
It's all my fault.

00:14:23.520 --> 00:14:26.360
It's because I said those things
that we got into a fight.

00:14:27.160 --> 00:14:32.000
Sis was the one who first said that we should
go look for Mom and Dad in Wonderland.

00:14:32.730 --> 00:14:35.100
Instead of waiting, she said
we should go get them!

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:37.130
Really?

00:14:37.240 --> 00:14:42.010
But I told her that she would never
be able to replace Mom.

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:01.320
Originally, we were all one.

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:04.700
Then we were separated,

00:15:04.930 --> 00:15:08.660
and scattered all over Wonderland
to sleep in crystal form.

00:15:10.940 --> 00:15:16.900
Those who have awakened are searching
out our sleeping brothers

00:15:17.340 --> 00:15:20.180
in order to take back our original shape.

00:15:22.920 --> 00:15:24.910
Why do you break everything?

00:15:26.390 --> 00:15:28.410
It's not that I want to break things,

00:15:28.660 --> 00:15:31.120
it's just that my very existence spells destruction.

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:40.900
It'd be nice if all of your brothers can
someday wear those clothes like you do.

00:15:44.810 --> 00:15:48.740
Thank you. You said you had a brother too.

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:53.750
Yeah, but all we do is fight.

00:15:53.980 --> 00:15:55.980
In fact, right now we're in the
middle of a huge one.

00:15:55.980 --> 00:15:57.510
But I'm so jealous.

00:15:58.550 --> 00:15:59.780
Jealous?

00:16:00.920 --> 00:16:04.410
Because you guys don't break
everything in sight, do you?

00:16:05.260 --> 00:16:08.060
People don't detest your existence, do they?

00:16:11.830 --> 00:16:13.560
Hey, do you want to come with me?

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:17.830
If you're wearing Flying Water, then
that means you've been to Teros, right?

00:16:17.970 --> 00:16:20.460
My friends are all looking for Flying Water too.

00:16:20.610 --> 00:16:23.170
So can you please just lead us to Teros?

00:16:23.940 --> 00:16:25.780
But I...

00:16:26.110 --> 00:16:30.570
It'll be all right! We'll help
you look for your brothers.

00:16:30.720 --> 00:16:32.350
Come on, let's go together!

00:16:35.290 --> 00:16:36.310
Okay?

00:16:57.280 --> 00:16:58.610
Mr. Kaze!

00:17:01.480 --> 00:17:04.210
What are you doing? Clear is not our enemy!

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:08.320
Get out of the way. Do you
not know his true identity?

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:09.860
What are you talking about?!

00:17:09.990 --> 00:17:12.250
You're the one who doesn't know
anything about Clear!

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:14.120
You'll die.

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:16.790
Stop it! Please, I'm begging you, stop!

00:17:41.690 --> 00:17:42.680
Over there!

00:17:42.960 --> 00:17:44.180
Could it be Sis?!

00:17:44.490 --> 00:17:45.690
Let's get going!

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:53.690
Poshepocket, please do something!

00:17:56.870 --> 00:18:01.200
Hey! This is no time to be sleeping! Wake up!

00:18:35.140 --> 00:18:36.730
Sis!

00:19:07.770 --> 00:19:08.870
<i>Ai...</i>

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:22.890
Omega's power is quite a frightful force indeed!

00:19:23.260 --> 00:19:27.350
Even the slightest move from him
destroyed an entire cube!

00:19:27.900 --> 00:19:30.660
Pist!

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:35.430
Hey there, did you enjoy that, Your Excellency?!

00:19:41.540 --> 00:19:44.070
Thank goodness! You're awake!

00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:48.370
Oh, Lisa, and Yu...

00:19:49.780 --> 00:19:53.380
Sis, I'm so sorry. I... I...

00:19:56.120 --> 00:19:58.990
It's okay. We're all that we have left.

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:01.190
We've got to get along.

00:20:10.900 --> 00:20:12.670
What is that glove?

00:20:13.640 --> 00:20:14.970
Flying Water.

00:20:15.780 --> 00:20:19.540
It's Clear's. It's used to stop
the power of Omega.

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:26.550
Clear, will I ever see you again?

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:36.500
And now the journey begins

